Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.96,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Does everyone have everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:10.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Did you all remember to bring your lunches and water bottles? Snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.69,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:15.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, Kobato, you guys aren't missing anything either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:15.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:18.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're not bringing anything with you on this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:23.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Excuse me, I need to get my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:30.42,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:33.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:13.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:16.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We're going on a class trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:21.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it was really lively around here. Is that why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! It's going to be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you need to come too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:28.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:36.13,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:37.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:45.00,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:48.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean, this is Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:49.19,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:52.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who's been allowed to work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.99,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Well aren't you lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:03:00.59,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Is Sayaka there? I'd like to speak to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, we're all about to go out on a field trip right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:06.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:10.15,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, there is. Could you pass on a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:11.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:14.98,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her to hurry up and stop playing around the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.41,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,I won't extend the deadline for her repayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Debt Collector?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:30.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you come to the nursery earlier and bully everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:34.55,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what those guys did...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:40.00,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you apologizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:44.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I've accused you of something you didn't do...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:51.07,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,You're an interesting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.46,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,But unfortunately, you don't have a job anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:07.98,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,I'm shutting down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:17.24,Default,Phone,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you tell Sayaka now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you're--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Shutting down the nursery...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:30.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think Miss Sayaka knows the guy who just called?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:37.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pass on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Take a nap or something when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You took forever, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How long were you gonna keep us waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.52,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:05.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, is the debt collector an acquaintance of Miss Sayaka's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:06.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:13.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A man called here earlier. He said he was going to shut down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:16.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Him, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.94,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell Miss Sayaka about the phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:23.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But he seemed like a scary person, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:40.02,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, Fujimoto, we're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, we'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:06:01.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The entrances are always in the weirdest places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:31.85,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:35.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:37.89,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.88,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The name of the store's a little too straight forward, doncha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:47.23,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing I can do about it. Both the shop name and the job were already picked out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:50.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He even decided that stuff for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:52.97,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You're in no place to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.19,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You've been given that form and you still haven't learned your lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:00.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to learn!\NI didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:04.16,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot! You caused such a commotion and you're still talking like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:10.35,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,If they heard what you said just now, they'd do worse than make you a stuffed animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.22,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be turned into some tiny one inch tall doll next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:19.20,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, that aside, what'd you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.96,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop stalling, just spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:27.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I have something I'd like you to look up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:34.13,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Really now. Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:40.43,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:42.31,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.33,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:48.13,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.67,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pond! A huge pond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.95,Default,Voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shut down the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who that person on the phone this morning was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:05.13,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Toshihiko, Marina! It's time for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.56,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:15.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Now I have a boo-boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:18.57,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you've been getting hurt all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like you've been zoning out all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:26.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:29.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's always spacing out, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not always!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:35.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't cause Miss Sayaka unnecessary worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:39.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:50.23,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I want info on Yomogi Nursery and everyone related to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:53.26,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What? What's with that pathetic look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:59.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Have the investigation skills you were so proud of gone rusty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.09,0:09:03.36,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,And your look is how many times more pathetic than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:07.36,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe you asked me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:08.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:11.44,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,In the past, you'd just command people to get info for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:15.11,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,And if they didn't listen, you'd start spitting fire and pulling punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:20.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then as you wish, an extra large fireball coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.45,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.14,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:28.88,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You! You've really gotten used to this job, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:37.84,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If your former underlings saw you doing this, they'd cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:41.49,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hear that from a stuffed animal like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.19,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll look into that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:49.24,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It's related to that girl, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:51.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. {I owe you one.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.78,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do as you've asked this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.32,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?! Don't eat other people's food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.63,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:13.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:16.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:19.97,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:25.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing! Nothing at all! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:27.48,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:33.32,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,But it's okay. I'm doing something good right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:37.78,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,If I can find one, it'll bring good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.19,0:10:42.12,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:44.61,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:50.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.39,Default,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissor, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:11:00.01,Default,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.18,0:11:03.49,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Kobato's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:10.19,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone go hide while Kobato counts to ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:11.65,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Try and find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:50.17,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is all I get as a souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:53.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If he just piled them up, I could've carried a bunch of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This body is so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:59.69,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,And you look pathetic to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:05.23,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna hear that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.11,0:12:13.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Ginsei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:19.63,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,That really is an embarrassing body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:52.69,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Even though your appearance is different, you're still the same on the inside, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:58.12,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,You can't change back at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I have something I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.63,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,It's that girl, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you do anything to Kobato, you can kiss your tail goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:17.58,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget. I'll definitely be back to settle the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:29.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:37.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where everyone's hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not here, hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:02.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.80,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato looks like she's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:10.35,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,She hasn't even found one person yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.46,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,She's looking in a strange place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,This looks like it's going to take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are so good at hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:21.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.81,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:28.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go yet! I'm "it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:29.73,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:33.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The person who's "it" needs to find all the hidden people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:36.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But it's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:39.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody, it's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.32,0:14:42.56,Default,Boys,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.45,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:56.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko and Yoshio, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.40,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... she did!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:02.21,Default,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,She found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:07.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru and Yukari, I see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:10.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Masao, I've got you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:11.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are people hiding over there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:17.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And over there! And there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:23.65,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,You still have leaves in your hair, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.90,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get them out for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Come, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:32.11,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.20,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe we should take a picture to remember this day by...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:40.37,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Marina's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.35,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,She really isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.10,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.68,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:54.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, please stay here with everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go help look too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:03.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:05.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:15.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:19.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she's still hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:23.83,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if she really was just playing around...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:28.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If only I had found her sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:35.81,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:40.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:44.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:08.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:19.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's... asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:28.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.53,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:41.02,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry... I couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you talking about our game of hide-and-seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:46.78,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,No, the four leaf clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:52.30,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,If I could find one, it would bring good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.45,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.35,0:17:57.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:03.72,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Because you looked kinda sad today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:13.80,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I looked everywhere, but I couldn't find one. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:23.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:34.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy because you tried so hard to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.83,0:18:39.27,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:47.90,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The view over here is nice. Let's take the picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:58.08,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Kiyokazu, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:19:00.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about me, look forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.35,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:15.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A four leaf clover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:28.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:32.20,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.84,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, look it, look it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:42.57,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:48.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We've found lots and lots of good luck, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Let's try taking that picture again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:53.08,Default,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:10.14,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,The baumkuchen's all broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:12.32,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,And after Master Genko went through so much trouble to give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:16.93,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on today?! It's one after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're one of the workers at that bear's place, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.84,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Your name was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:33.24,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,It's Zuisho! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.20,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I have a message from Master Genko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.20,0:20:37.34,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,He said he's finished investigating what you asked him about!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:38.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:40.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's Genko for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.24,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Even Nihiru would laugh at you in that form.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:45.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say bird brain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:54.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:01.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Ioryogi hasn't come back yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:09.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! Ioryogi's so small, I hope he didn't get stuck somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:12.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Or fall into a crack in the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:15.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Or get crushed somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:18.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, this is bad! Ioryogi's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:21.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who's in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:24.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:26.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.27,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:35.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.79,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And? How was the field trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:42.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! I have something for you, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:43.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A good luck clover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:51.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little wilted, but I brought one for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:58.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wish that everyone can stay together in good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:01.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.35,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Reporting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:13.89,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently the previous head of Yomogi Nursery was tricked and forced to borrow a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.14,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The previous head?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:21.82,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka Okiura's father. He passed away two years ago or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:28.24,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,The ones who tricked him were pretty dangerous guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:33.10,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,and now they're harassing Sayaka Okiura too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:36.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a problem now isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:44.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If things keep going like this, sooner or later, Yomogi Nursery is going to get shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.96,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:49.63,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.81,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:49.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:53.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:56.21,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:01:03.55,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:09.13,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.97,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:16.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:22.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:27.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:30.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:33.96,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:36.72,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:39.46,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:46.34,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:50.35,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:55.00,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
